ENTRY 11127 {"id":11127,"kind":"pi.tool-result","messages":[{"role":"toolResult","text":"packages/orchestrator/test/inbox.test.ts:4:import { deleteRetryDelayMs, InboxLoop } from \"../src/inbox.ts\";\npackages/orchestrator/test/inbox.test.ts:8:/** In-memory inbox.events for one session, answering only the statements InboxLoop issues. */\npackages/orchestrator/test/inbox.test.ts:92:describe(\"deleteRetryDelayMs\", () => {\npackages/orchestrator/test/inbox.test.ts:94:    expect([1, 2, 3, 4].map(deleteRetryDelayMs)).toEqual([1_000, 2_000, 4_000, 8_000]);\npackages/orchestrator/test/inbox.test.ts:95:    expect(deleteRetryDelayMs(7)).toBe(60_000);\npackages/orchestrator/test/inbox.test.ts:96:    expect(deleteRetryDelayMs(500)).toBe(60_000);\npackages/orchestrator/test/inbox.test.ts:110:    const loop = new InboxLoop(inbox.pool(), apply);\npackages/orchestrator/test/inbox.test.ts:134:    const loop = new InboxLoop(inbox.pool(), () => Promise.reject(new PermanentError(\"gone\")));\npackages/orchestrator/test/inbox.test.ts:143:    const loop = new InboxLoop(inbox.pool(), () => Promise.reject(new Error(\"boom\")));\npackages/orchestrator/test/inbox.test.ts:165:    const loop = new InboxLoop(pool, apply);\npackages/orchestrator/src/inbox.ts:19:export function deleteRetryDelayMs(attempt: number): number {\npackages/orchestrator/src/inbox.ts:39:export class InboxLoop {\npackages/orchestrator/src/inbox.ts:213:        this.#notBefore.set(event.sessionId, Date.now() + deleteRetryDelayMs(attempt));\npackages/orchestrator/src/main.ts:19:import { InboxLoop } from \"./inbox.js\";\npackages/orchestrator/src/main.ts:41:  const running: { inbox?: InboxLoop; service?: SessionService; sweeper?: OrphanSweeper } = {};\npackages/orchestrator/src/main.ts:160:  const inbox = new InboxLoop(pool, (event, session) => service.apply(event, session));\ndocs/research/phase1-apis.md:122:- In v1beta1 a **SandboxClaim references a SandboxWarmPool, not a SandboxTemplate**: `spec.warmPoolRef` is `required` (CRD in `extensions.yaml` v1.0.11; `extensions/api/v1beta1/sandboxclaim_types.go:110-112`). The SandboxWarmPool references the template via `spec.sandboxTemplateRef.name`. A warm pool can have `replicas: 0` (`Minimum=0`, default 1; `sandboxwarmpool_types.go:41-46`), so cold-start-only is expressible: UNVERIFIED that replicas 0 behaves as a pure template alias in practice.\ndocs/research/phase1-apis.md:155:  replicas: 0\ndocs/decisions/0005-migrations-without-ddl-locks.md:9:1. The orchestrator's inbox drain (`InboxLoop.#drain`) opens a transaction, locks the claimed `inbox.events` rows\ndocs/decisions/0006-deletes-retry-until-done.md:7:`InboxLoop` marks an event `failed` after `MAX_ATTEMPTS` (5) tries. The poll interval is 1 s, so five tries fit in a\ndocs/decisions/0001-per-sandbox-sandboxd-token.md:32:- Claims with `spec.env` cold-start a Pod; the warm pool has `replicas: 0`, so nothing changes.\nbridge-launcher.ts\nconfig.ts\nfailure.ts\ngithub-app.ts\nhost.ts\nhttp.ts\ninbox.ts\nkube.ts\nlifecycle.ts\nlog.ts\nmain.ts\nmodel.ts\nonecli-admin.ts\nonecli.ts\nproviders.ts\nrepo-access.ts\nsandboxes.ts\nsessions.ts\nstorage.ts\nstream.ts\nsweep.ts\nsweeper.ts\nwatcher.ts\nworkspace.ts\n","isError":false}]}
